    "cover": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjlhRVtP0e50yPgndZnFS09cQ-tP2zEhp-l1iRa7bEjlxNKxzPsz5LPvbB5po2SlidBpQaX1drdw26bzXZyv8-c4Y3FcinG0Qz3pFU-S8-STY7oFHznS8TtuayYblx39mfOJbnUFWvHHeYI4bwv1nD7_oIXTcsipdcUtRufpk4Rs7VUr27GwdWL3ISgbdN1=w400-h269",
    "emoji": "📝",
    "body": "<div class=\"blogger-post\"><p>This was my final project at BWSI, and part of the reason I received the Dr. Bob Berman Disruptive Tech Award for e-textiles this year for BWSI. I'm so excited about it and plan to continue it in the coming months.&nbsp;</p><p></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjlhRVtP0e50yPgndZnFS09cQ-tP2zEhp-l1iRa7bEjlxNKxzPsz5LPvbB5po2SlidBpQaX1drdw26bzXZyv8-c4Y3FcinG0Qz3pFU-S8-STY7oFHznS8TtuayYblx39mfOJbnUFWvHHeYI4bwv1nD7_oIXTcsipdcUtRufpk4Rs7VUr27GwdWL3ISgbdN1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjlhRVtP0e50yPgndZnFS09cQ-tP2zEhp-l1iRa7bEjlxNKxzPsz5LPvbB5po2SlidBpQaX1drdw26bzXZyv8-c4Y3FcinG0Qz3pFU-S8-STY7oFHznS8TtuayYblx39mfOJbnUFWvHHeYI4bwv1nD7_oIXTcsipdcUtRufpk4Rs7VUr27GwdWL3ISgbdN1=w400-h269\" /></a></div><br /><br /><p></p><p>I have so much to say in this post, but for now I'll just share screenshots of my portfolio document and go on and on about it when I'm not compromising on sleep lol:</p><p><br /></p><p></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhcgghbybe_8M2EfFsowEblgp1NrW2Qm1Z6sxV8UiGlG5Ilru1JqUTUg13dvO5vzZXt06jPhi4uK7z1LcN31tZteXdCZZpYHA9HShb-HvaKsrtvdHqm5LgUr6qd-ZtkzBBKpkOo-pD4ee6ie_gmDL_eD0kck2_TZyrs2lUhcX_-_x67hrduiT9ozi8vnB-m\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhcgghbybe_8M2EfFsowEblgp1NrW2Qm1Z6sxV8UiGlG5Ilru1JqUTUg13dvO5vzZXt06jPhi4uK7z1LcN31tZteXdCZZpYHA9HShb-HvaKsrtvdHqm5LgUr6qd-ZtkzBBKpkOo-pD4ee6ie_gmDL_eD0kck2_TZyrs2lUhcX_-_x67hrduiT9ozi8vnB-m=w640-h543\" /></a></div><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjMRS7NqTQj-WerfbaMWgWS_HB5ajHBZH57ac5mXgwY_EhC-BwgLMBhWkkAoRtzW7mkXDRt0My4xaGvz_ts4e0ISII6MvhhFDpBokXBy8N6O3YogU-Rfp8qvxgplLGWK5brDl0cs7vu6iKKMiE_9eCHNVsCqGUDw5s51lZT6bnyiuO3z8hWlGDDj7S3y7wz\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjMRS7NqTQj-WerfbaMWgWS_HB5ajHBZH57ac5mXgwY_EhC-BwgLMBhWkkAoRtzW7mkXDRt0My4xaGvz_ts4e0ISII6MvhhFDpBokXBy8N6O3YogU-Rfp8qvxgplLGWK5brDl0cs7vu6iKKMiE_9eCHNVsCqGUDw5s51lZT6bnyiuO3z8hWlGDDj7S3y7wz=w640-h547\" /></a></div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiNoVM6RFsSmzTDbzqZ6_3NsVaG4X0N4f4RDz6MvnV5fYhhA-Xk0J_ZK8Q4VrgCS5vguwcou9Y6hxo85XXlYFIcdvyEqNMludNL4YYRWpeqStiUk3rsOHptm7QZuuTpFSlhR3rxEhm4_TtVG8gG-Yccb369r7SEbtK_ASUIIE49LD35C13EWEUGDUCt9KLS\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiNoVM6RFsSmzTDbzqZ6_3NsVaG4X0N4f4RDz6MvnV5fYhhA-Xk0J_ZK8Q4VrgCS5vguwcou9Y6hxo85XXlYFIcdvyEqNMludNL4YYRWpeqStiUk3rsOHptm7QZuuTpFSlhR3rxEhm4_TtVG8gG-Yccb369r7SEbtK_ASUIIE49LD35C13EWEUGDUCt9KLS=w640-h555\" /></a></div><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhTg4eboaUOtrj01Y6dEgoAhjqz9K28xPzb7zSneYZo6vNw5MGprLZYn9dYCbAYe2DjdbW3UolO6jmt9HroYTcMmhtJJiG27mk1EfZjXUBg-33DpfBRg9qLh0jkF2lyAOOwN5y9mrb_5f9vRgYswXl4M1JfQDnQk6ETzC2GEx_Nmo-Fl4ePZNXJ6qj4E1Ee\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhTg4eboaUOtrj01Y6dEgoAhjqz9K28xPzb7zSneYZo6vNw5MGprLZYn9dYCbAYe2DjdbW3UolO6jmt9HroYTcMmhtJJiG27mk1EfZjXUBg-33DpfBRg9qLh0jkF2lyAOOwN5y9mrb_5f9vRgYswXl4M1JfQDnQk6ETzC2GEx_Nmo-Fl4ePZNXJ6qj4E1Ee=w640-h584\" /></a></div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhDdCojBVezSCezmzbswy9vtXxlRj0hxDl1djkK1gS8aU2Syn7GUIvZIH-d4pZwnHQyP3ShLNJDyLGah1ulDQRtJZiibsbV7TPQvs5-gIZ47usqhmlimkfJwF8g75u8sn2-6MP8j9H0Et-JxrtVUCFp1qtfrijp-2nAzu0LK1XW05uVN1pxSwfBFyes2oal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhDdCojBVezSCezmzbswy9vtXxlRj0hxDl1djkK1gS8aU2Syn7GUIvZIH-d4pZwnHQyP3ShLNJDyLGah1ulDQRtJZiibsbV7TPQvs5-gIZ47usqhmlimkfJwF8g75u8sn2-6MP8j9H0Et-JxrtVUCFp1qtfrijp-2nAzu0LK1XW05uVN1pxSwfBFyes2oal=w640-h362\" /></a></div><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgEBB607qF5thN9OudU1S1IkAFzKPUCP6hoWYaaLxkj77Z_EbzisYSzscgQWcJJnV2OHheJUz6SGRlvc_X20tqijJ44_Akik3s-A6y_-5nHFAxGWVu5rhijBDa7zMLQIMyof-byU9zHzzQsRaTWKNFGPYwI35n47GL3gNF7MqnhBBG0F_WPDRHl_615qWbS\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgEBB607qF5thN9OudU1S1IkAFzKPUCP6hoWYaaLxkj77Z_EbzisYSzscgQWcJJnV2OHheJUz6SGRlvc_X20tqijJ44_Akik3s-A6y_-5nHFAxGWVu5rhijBDa7zMLQIMyof-byU9zHzzQsRaTWKNFGPYwI35n47GL3gNF7MqnhBBG0F_WPDRHl_615qWbS=w640-h489\" /></a></div><br /><br /></div><br /><br /><br /></div>Up Next:&nbsp;</div><div>-Experimenting with more motors&nbsp;</div><div>-Inserting batteries&nbsp;</div><div>-Expanding health monitoring UI!&nbsp;<br /><br /><br /></div><br /><br /><p></p></div>\n"
